2026-06-26 15:23:00,422 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
2026-06-26 15:23:00,423 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Our company, Faber IA, offers an artificial intelligence assistance solution through our platform Atelier, which is designed to improve productivity and quality of work. The core approach of our AI solution is based on retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), where every answer is generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites those passages. This grounding in validated material ensures that answers are reliable and traceable.

Our ai_llm_rag_capabilities include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting. These capabilities enable us to provide contextualised answers grounded in cited sources, supporting professionals in their daily activities.

To ensure explainability, our solution features source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and every interaction is logged for a posteriori audit. This transparency allows professionals to understand how the solution arrived at its answers, ensuring trust and reliability.

Our innovation strategy involves an iterative approach, with steps including corpus curation with the firm's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loop. We measure answer quality using a labelled evaluation set built with the client, focusing on groundedness, relevance, factual support, and correctness of cited figures.

Our solution is designed to be non-decisional, providing assistance while ensuring that professionals maintain control and validation of outputs. The chartered accountant or statutory auditor validates and signs deliverables, guaranteeing the quality and reliability of the work.

By leveraging our Atelier platform and RAG-based AI capabilities, we can provide a reliable, explainable, and traceable solution that meets the client's requirements for improved productivity and quality of work, while ensuring the integrity and validity of the outputs.
